## Resolved mutable: m-terrain-app-ordering-regression

BOTH symptoms fixed + isolated. (1) Spawn-point drop 77->4: caused by starting the streamer from the terrain app's server.setup (raced the tps-game spawn-finder). Fix: keep the streamer start in WorkerEntry/ServerAPI BEFORE stage load (reading config from the terrain entity or legacy worldDef.terrain), terrain app server.setup is declarative-only. browser/server log: '[tps-game] 77 spawn points validated' restored. (2) Veg not building: caused by the terrain app's client.setup calling ctx.setTerrainConfig(mergeConfig(ctx.config)) -- client app ctx has NO entity config, so mergeConfig(undefined) produced a DEFAULT config (vegetation.enabled:false, wrong anchorDir/seed) that CLOBBERED the good _terrainCfg from wd.terrain. Isolated by git-stash A/B: clean code veg=4837, my code veg=0. Fix: removed the client setTerrainConfig push (client gets config from wd.terrain); rebuildTerrain now MERGES a partial override onto live _terrainCfg. browser-41: veg=4837 restored, ground00 -0.73 reliefScale 0.001 radius 63600 parity intact, onGround true.